{"id":"99cc98508e51c9ee","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-ordinal-analysis.md","title":"相对于记法与公式类的归纳序数","display":"df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法与公式类的归纳序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-ordinal-analysis","aliases":["91-df-ordinal-analysis","91-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","91-df-ordinal-strength"],"display":"df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法与公式类的归纳序数","depends_on":["[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-ordinal-analysis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-ordinal-analysis</span><span>91-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</span><span>91-df-ordinal-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-analysis — 相对于记法与公式类的归纳序数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathcal T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(O,\\prec)\">\\((O,\\prec)\\)</span> 为固定原始递归良序记法系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ot}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{ot}(a)\\)</span> 为标准初段的序型。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为允许的归纳公式类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in O\">\\(a\\in O\\)</span> 是元层标准记法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal T|_{O,\\mathcal C}\">\\(|\\mathcal T|_{O,\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为下述模式及外部上确界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}analysis}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,\\left[\n\\forall x\\in O\\left(x\\prec\\overline a\\to(\\forall z\\prec x\\,\\varphi(z,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(x,\\vec y))\\right)\n\\to\\forall x\\prec\\overline a\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\right]:\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}analysis}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,\\left[\n\\forall x\\in O\\left(x\\prec\\overline a\\to(\\forall z\\prec x\\,\\varphi(z,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(x,\\vec y))\\right)\n\\to\\forall x\\prec\\overline a\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\right]:\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal T|_{O,\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{\\operatorname{ot}(a):a\\in O,\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\\ (\\mathcal T\\vdash\\sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathcal T|_{O,\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{\\operatorname{ot}(a):a\\in O,\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\\ (\\mathcal T\\vdash\\sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是明确参数化的外部归纳能力指标；要把它等同某文献的“证明论序数”须使用相同校准并完成上下界分析。旧定义使用未说明的一阶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 句，实际完整良基性通常需要二阶子集量化，现用对象一阶的超限归纳模式展开。\n层级长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 不是 FS 或 KF 的证明论序数。原书对强度优先给出与迭代真理理论的归约，强调其对基础理论和归纳范围的依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：§6 末；§9.1，印刷页 111–114；§15.3，印刷页 204–210；本指标为参数化辅助约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"(O,\\prec)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ot}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal T|_{O,\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}analysis}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec y\\,\\left[\n\\forall x\\in O\\left(x\\prec\\overline a\\to(\\forall z\\prec x\\,\\varphi(z,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(x,\\vec y))\\right)\n\\to\\forall x\\prec\\overline a\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\right]:\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"|\\mathcal T|_{O,\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\n\\sup\\{\\operatorname{ot}(a):a\\in O,\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{TI}_{\\mathcal C}(a)\\ (\\mathcal T\\vdash\\sigma)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false}],"bytes":1870,"backlinks":[{"id":"37e8c28d922b32f1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-ordinal-analysis]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-